<title>JAPAN: Japan's March kerosene stocks up 37.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan's March kerosene stocks up 37.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's kerosene stockpiles stood at 2.4 million kilolitres (kl) as of the end of March, up 37.4 percent from a year earlier, the Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) said on Friday.</p>
<p>Month-over-month, stocks were down 5.1 percent from February.</p>
<p>Sales of kerosene during the four-month period from November to February accounted for about 60 percent of total annual sales in volume terms.</p>
</text>
